{"t": 1792881012188, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "feed7_rehungry", "Feed Residents only feeds members already hungry. At tick 206038 'You fed 6 residents' and the same frame-second the banner says '3 members hungry: all here' and the button 'Feed Residents (3 hungry)' (screenshot). A second click fed the other 3 at tick 206190. The three readouts agree with each other, but a player expects one Feed click to feed everyone present; feeding the nearly-hungry too (or saying 'X more will be hungry soon') would avoid the double-click and the impression the feed failed."]}
{"t": 1792881012544, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "nameplate_overlap", "Settlement nameplate '8 here, 9/16 residents' renders in huge world-space text across the top of the screen over the HUD ('? Controls' button and Era panel) when standing inside the settlement. It is clipped and hard to read. Seen throughout ticks 187000-206000."]}
