{"t": 1792881072612, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "tier_vs_era", "After building a 3rd house (tick 206558) the status says 'The settlement is now a Town!' and Settlement Info shows 'Tier: Town (5 buildings)' with a 'Send Caravan (Town era)' button, yet the Era panel still says 'Camp (1/4)' and Objective 7 still asks to 'Reach the Village era' (Members 9/10). Two parallel ladders named Village/Town (settlement tier vs nation era) read as contradictory."]}
